    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1.1
  m_Text: "Missing Person Incident Report \u2014 Family Copy\nDate: September 3,
    1972\nCase No.: 0931-05\n\nThis record has been compiled based on accounts from
    residents and related individuals:\n\n1. Subject Information: Female child, age
    5. Last seen on August 31 at dusk, inside the family residence.\n\n2. Incident
    Summary: Multiple neighbors reported prolonged arguments from within the household
    that night, followed by the sound of a heavy object falling. The child was not
    seen afterward.\n\n3. Family Statement: Parents claim the child had shown unstable
    emotions recently and was prone to wandering off alone. On the day of the incident,
    she may have left the house by herself.\n\n4. Investigation Status: No verified
    sightings to date. Current assumption is that the child has departed the residence.\n\n5.
    Community Condition: Uncertainty surrounding the case has led to widespread speculation.
    Recommendations have been made for the family to strengthen household security.\n\nNote:
    This document is for record and notification purposes only. Further investigation
    remains ongoing."
